?p=1000106#post1000106\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So I just finished Chapter 2, and while it will warrant another post in whole, cause fairness, for now I want to say this:<br /> <br /> If you told me that people skipped Chapter 1, read this, and got hooked, I'd completely understand. It had some problems, but this was not a bad chapter.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think the obvious question is how in HELL did you write that quite lengthy bashing of the game while ONLY READING A SINGLE CHAPTER OF IT.<br /> <br /> I mean the stupidity of fangame haters barely fazes me anymore but come on.<br /> You can't even understand what makes this game so fun until you reached the Wonder creation bits but did you just dismiss it so hard you felt it was neccessary to bash it here, based on only an intro chapter?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2330-vree","name":"Vree","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"176"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-30T11:45:47-07:00","id":1145591,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vree</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/950278-dissecting-transgression-arcane-reviews-genius?p=1145568#post1145568\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I think the obvious question is how in HELL did you write that quite lengthy bashing of the game while ONLY READING A SINGLE CHAPTER OF IT.<br /> <br /> I mean the stupidity of fangame haters barely fazes me anymore but come on.<br /> You can't even understand what makes this game so fun until you reached the Wonder creation bits but did you just dismiss it so hard you felt it was neccessary to bash it here, based on only an intro chapter?</div> </div> </div> </div>Arts's prior hostility was based on fan reactions, initially. Your hostile/dismissive tone is hardly helping.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":11}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-30T16:22:50-07:00","id":1145658,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vree</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/950278-dissecting-transgression-arcane-reviews-genius?p=1145568#post1145568\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I think the obvious question is how in HELL did you write that quite lengthy bashing of the game while ONLY READING A SINGLE CHAPTER OF IT.<br /> <br /> I mean the stupidity of fangame haters barely fazes me anymore but come on.<br /> You can't even understand what makes this game so fun until you reached the Wonder creation bits but did you just dismiss it so hard you felt it was neccessary to bash it here, based on only an intro chapter?</div> </div> </div> </div>I do not hate fangames. I am openly a fan of Princess the Hopeful and Immortal the Quickening, and have very fond feelings about Dragon and Leviathan. I come from a background of working with fangames and maintain an open advocacy for fan games and fan material in general. I have a working defense for Why Mary Sues Are Not Inherently Bad Things, for fuck's sake.<br /> <br /> I had that much to say about one chapter of Genius because that one chapter, and the intro, were <i>really fucking bad</i>. And you know, that'd have been fine? Except that this is the chapter that's supposed to sell me on the game. This is supposed to be my break down introduction to the world, the setting, the things I'm going to tell a story with. Mechanics only serve to make that all work, and I don't much care how good any of those are if the thing I end up playing is a putrid sack of shit.<br /> <br /> Chapter two was pretty cool. And then after that, I kind of got burnt out and haven't read the rest of it. People like you do not help motivate me to pick it back up and get a full opinion, and I avoided reading it for years because of people like you.<br /> <br /> Maybe you should consider that before getting on my case for not liking a game you do. A good foot forward on your part can do way more for an opinion on Genius than Genius can right now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":99,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","user":"ArcaneArts","date":". 09-30-2017, 07:30 PM